## 通用错误响应

所有接口在参数校验失败时返回 HTTP 400：

```json
{ "error": "interval must be '15min' or '1hour'" }
{ "error": "startDate must be less than or equal to endDate" }
{ "error": "period must be 7 or 30" }
```
